# Admin Dashboard Refactoring — Priorities 1-3

Three major refactors to improve maintainability: extracting shared utilities, splitting the monolithic server, and decomposing oversized page components.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> There are no existing automated tests in this project. Verification will rely on `npm run build` (Vite production build validates all imports/exports) and a manual smoke test of the dev server. The refactoring is purely structural — no behavior changes.

## Proposed Changes

### Shared Frontend Utilities (Priority 2 — done first, it's a dependency for Priority 3)

Extract duplicated functions from page components into shared modules.

#### [NEW] [formatters.js](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/src/utils/formatters.js)

- [formatCurrency(value)](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/depositSlip.js#93-103) — currently duplicated in `Finance.jsx`, `Buildings.jsx`, `Vestry.jsx`
- `formatPhone(value)` — currently duplicated in `People.jsx`, `Buildings.jsx`

#### [NEW] [taskProgress.js](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/src/utils/taskProgress.js)

- `getSortedProgressSteps(task)` — duplicated in `Todo.jsx`, `Dashboard.jsx`
- `getTaskProgressMeta(task)` — duplicated in `Todo.jsx`, `Dashboard.jsx`, `Calendar.jsx`, `Buildings.jsx`
- `getTaskProgressLabel(task)` — duplicated in `Todo.jsx`, `Dashboard.jsx`

#### [MODIFY] Affected page components

Each of `Finance.jsx`, `Buildings.jsx`, `Vestry.jsx`, `People.jsx`, `Todo.jsx`, `Dashboard.jsx`, `Calendar.jsx` will be updated to import from the new utility modules, removing their local duplicate definitions.

---

### Server Route Splitting (Priority 1)

Split [server/index.js](file:///C:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/index.js) (9,167 lines) into route modules. The new [index.js](file:///C:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/index.js) will only handle app setup, middleware, and mounting route files.

#### [NEW] [helpers.js](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers.js)

Shared utility functions used across multiple route files:
- DB utilities: [tableExists](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers/db-utils.js#3-8), [tableHasColumn](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers/db-utils.js#9-14), [coerceJsonArray](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers/db-utils.js#15-31), [coerceJsonObject](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers/db-utils.js#32-45), [parseJsonField](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers/db-utils.js#48-53)
- People utilities: `normalizeName`, `slugifyName`, [buildPeopleIndex](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/index.js#602-630), [normalizeScheduleValue](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/index.js#631-653), [normalizeAssignmentList](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/index.js#2601-2608), `normalizePersonName`, `normalizePersonRoles`, `normalizeTags`
- Date/string helpers: `normalizeDateKey`, `sanitizeFileSegment`, [clampPriority](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/helpers/task-utils.js#4-8), etc.

#### [NEW] [routes/auth.js](file:///c:/Users/Secretary/Documents/Admin%20Dashboard/server/routes/auth.js)

