### Page Component Decomposition (Priority 3)

Break down the five largest page components by extracting custom hooks (data fetching + state logic) and sub-components (render logic).

#### Sunday.jsx (2,273 → ~300 lines)

- [NEW] `pages/sunday/useSundayData.js` — all data loading, state management, and API calls
- [NEW] `pages/sunday/SundayRosterPanel.jsx` — role assignment UI, person selection menus
- [NEW] `pages/sunday/SundayBulletinStatus.jsx` — bulletin/insert status pipeline
- [NEW] `pages/sunday/SundayHgkPanel.jsx` — HGK supply management section
- [NEW] `pages/sunday/SundayLivestreamPanel.jsx` — livestream + email section  
- [NEW] `pages/sunday/sundayHelpers.js` — constants and formatting helpers specific to Sunday
- [MODIFY] `pages/Sunday.jsx` — becomes a thin orchestrator importing sub-components

#### Todo.jsx (1,568 → ~300 lines)

- [NEW] `pages/todo/useTodoData.js` — task loading, sorting, filtering state
- [NEW] `pages/todo/TodoListCard.jsx` — the task list card with progress indicators
- [NEW] `pages/todo/TodoDetailPanel.jsx` — task detail/editing panel
- [NEW] `pages/todo/TodoAddForm.jsx` — add-task form
- [NEW] `pages/todo/todoHelpers.js` — sorting, due-date logic, formatting helpers
- [MODIFY] `pages/Todo.jsx` — orchestrator

#### Buildings.jsx (1,299 → ~250 lines)

- [NEW] `pages/buildings/useBuildingsData.js` — data loading hook
- [NEW] `pages/buildings/BuildingsMap.jsx` — interactive SVG campus map
- [NEW] `pages/buildings/BuildingsTickets.jsx` — ticket management panel
- [NEW] `pages/buildings/BuildingsVendors.jsx` — vendor list
- [NEW] `pages/buildings/BuildingsNeeds.jsx` — maintenance needs
- [MODIFY] `pages/Buildings.jsx` — orchestrator

#### People.jsx (1,059 → ~200 lines)

- [NEW] `pages/people/usePeopleData.js` — data loading, filtering
- [NEW] `pages/people/PeopleDetailPanel.jsx` — detail/edit panel (420 lines extracted)
- [NEW] `pages/people/PeopleForm.jsx` — create/edit form
- [MODIFY] `pages/People.jsx` — orchestrator with list view

#### Vestry.jsx (1,182 → ~250 lines)

- [NEW] `pages/vestry/useVestryData.js` — data loading hook
- [NEW] `pages/vestry/VestryPacketBuilder.jsx` — packet assembly UI
- [NEW] `pages/vestry/VestryCertificatePanel.jsx` — certificate entry + preview
- [NEW] `pages/vestry/VestryChecklist.jsx` — monthly checklist view
- [MODIFY] `pages/Vestry.jsx` — orchestrator

