## Verification Plan

### Automated Build Check

```bash
cd "c:\Users\Secretary\Documents\Admin Dashboard"
npm run build
```

This validates all imports/exports are correct. Any broken import from the refactoring will fail the Vite build with a clear error.

### Manual Smoke Test

After the build succeeds, start the dev server and verify key pages load:

1. Run `npm run dev:both` to start both client and server
2. Open the dashboard in a browser
3. Navigate to each route in the sidebar — verify each page loads without console errors
4. Specifically test: Overview, Sunday Planner, Calendar, Finance, Buildings, People, To-Do, Vestry
